# --- Scientific data / outputs (safety net: this repo is metadata-only) ---
# Common large/binary scientific formats that should NOT be committed here.
# Component repositories may relax these rules.
*.nc
*.nc4
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.npz
*.npy
*.zarr/
*.pkl
*.pickle
